{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21196","headline":"寄隐客 · 元稹","name":"寄隐客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我年三十二，鬓有八九丝。\n非无官次第，其如身早衰。\n今人夸贵富，肉食与妖姬。\n而我俱不乐，贵富亦何爲。\n况逢多士朝，贤俊若布棊。\n班行次第立，朱紫相参差。\n谟猷密勿进，羽檄纵横驰。\n监察官甚小，发言无所裨。\n小官仍不了，谴夺亦已随。\n时或不之弃，得不自弃之。\n陶君喜不遇，顾我复何疑。\n潜书周隐士，白云今有期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21196.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21196","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}